					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 3: FLOAT2 TO TEXTURE\n\nIn this example we are converting a Float2 to a Texture2D RGBA by using the Texture from Data node.\nBecause we are missing a blue and alpha channel we are only getting colors that are a mix of green and red."
					}
				},
