					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "FLOAT 2\n\nThe Float2 node constructs a float2 signal out of two regular float signals.\nThis node is very useful when creating X\/Y positions for shapes, textures, slices and meshes.\n\nTo convert from other types to a float 2 type directly: use the To Float2 node."
					}
				},
